  "description": "Framed for the murder of the countess she served, Isabel Gemnin was executed, leaving her beloved daughter behind. Death should have been the end, but Isabel wakes in another woman's body to find that ten years have passed and she has only one year left to live. Now, she must find her way back to her daughter while uncovering the secrets tied to the identity she has awakened into.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
